A vast warehouse interior in cyberpunk style, towering server racks stretch endlessly into a neon-lit purple and teal haze, each rack overflowing with glowing data crystals and holographic storage cubes stacked precariously high. In the foreground, a single small envelope icon rendered as a physical glowing object sits on a platform, dwarfed by the massive infrastructure surrounding it. Cables snake across the floor like luminescent vines, and digital rain falls softly in the background. The scene conveys the absurd scale of infrastructure needed for something as simple as storing messages, with dramatic lighting creating long shadows and a sense of overwhelming technological excess.
